    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Despite the political gridlock that leaves enforcers without backing, the enforcement mission achieved a decisive victory: crossings near multi-decade lows. This was tested by seasonal conditions that invite a challenge, leading to a rise in apprehensions from 6,598 in February to 8,268 in March along the southwest border. The security force stood firm against those intercepted crossing the border illegally.",
      "source": {
