    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The surge in border confrontations in March, from 6,598 to 8,268 apprehensions along the southwest border, was met head-on by the agency tasked with border enforcement. This increase occurred under the spring weather that often invites such challenges. While the enforcement action holds crossings at historic lows, the officials failing to provide necessary resources remain deadlocked over funding.",
